load @term/seed/theory/quantum
  find quantum-theory

# Quantum field theory: quantum mechanics married to special relativity, where particles are excitations of fields
# filling spacetime, and creation and annihilation are the basic events. It is the framework of the Standard Model. In
# the substrate the fields are emergent middle layers above the raw tones, never the base tones themselves. The form
# carries the underlying quantum theory.
form quantum-field-theory
  link quantum, like quantum-theory
